{
  "Project A": {
    "Pros": [
      "• Clarity of value proposition: Clear focus on ruggedness, durability, and off-grid reliability for specific user segments (RV, tiny homes, emergencies).",
      "• Market size and demand: Targets growing markets in off-grid living, van life/RV travel, and emergency preparedness with a defined need.",
      "• Differentiation: Strong emphasis on industrial-grade construction (diamond plate, solid wheels) vs. typical consumer plastic power stations.",
