      "• Risk awareness and mitigation: Identifies component sourcing as a key risk and proposes dual-sourcing strategy."
    ],
    "Cons": [
      "• Revenue model and sustainability: No details on pricing, long-term business model, or post-campaign sales strategy. Relies on a single batch of 100 units.",
      "• Impact and evidence plan: Lacks concrete evidence of performance (e.g., test data, certifications, user testimonials). No warranty information provided to back durability claims.",
      "• Team & Partnerships: Team described vaguely as 'artisans and engineers'; no specific expertise or partner names given to build confidence.",
      "• Roadmap: Lacks detail on certifications (e.g., UL), testing phases, or scaling beyond the initial batch."
