      "• Impact and evidence plan: Explicitly mentions a target 3-year warranty, which adds credibility to durability claims and provides a customer assurance plan not present in Project A.",
      "• This single added, concrete commitment slightly improves perceived reliability and reduces post-purchase risk for backers."
    ],
    "Cons": [
      "• Shares all cons from Project A regarding vague revenue model, lack of detailed evidence/test data, undefined team expertise, and limited roadmap.",
